[[0,1110065,0,292,5,287,"2016-06-15T17:43:57","stanky_bawls","",[],"","Another masterpiece from Ben Garrison","https://i.sli.mg/rRWpAq.jpg","TheDonald"],[1,5519350,0,25,2,23,"2016-06-15T18:21:23","Stop_The_Silence","",[],"<p>Wow.. I literally just spoke about the &quot; Leftist's lens&quot; regarding this very issue.</p>\n<p>I was just talking to a buddy and said that the leftists see things through their own lens where Islamic terrorism is the fault of White Christians... I just fucking said that 2 mins before seeing this caricature. </p>"],[2,5519496,5519350,10,1,9,"2016-06-15T18:33:31","pessimisticsteel","",[],"<p>Want me to bake you a cake? /s</p>"],[3,5519546,5519496,11,2,9,"2016-06-15T18:36:51","Stop_The_Silence","",[],"<p>I actually would. </p>"],[4,5519584,5519546,2,0,2,"2016-06-15T18:39:39","pessimisticsteel","",[],"<p>Sure, just pm me your address. I promise nothing weird will happen. :)</p>"],[5,5520145,5519584,2,0,2,"2016-06-15T19:33:46","Womb_Raider","[e]",[],"<p>But what are you doing packing a cardboard box full of double sided black dildos?</p>"],[6,5520829,5520145,1,0,1,"2016-06-15T20:27:57","dingomeat","",[],"<p>Oh, he ran out of packing popcorn</p>"],[1,5519705,0,4,0,4,"2016-06-15T18:51:12","HankRHill","",[],"<p>The lapel pin is an excellent touch</p>"],[1,5519756,0,6,0,6,"2016-06-15T18:56:34","lordtyp0","[e]",[],"<p>I was a bit shocked over the Howell case.</p>\n<p>Make no mistake, the man is stupid. You do <em>not</em> transport firearms without understanding the laws where you are traveling to, nor do you leave three rifles in your parked car at an event.</p>\n<p>But.</p>\n<p>I saw an article, was on some site like democracynow or something. Headline was &quot;FAR RIGHT, ANTI-GAY TERRORIST THAT WAS STOPPED BY THE POLICE!&quot;</p>\n<p>Events:</p>\n<p>A gay or bi- guy knocked on a house and window early in the morning. No reason supplied but to me it sounds like he thought he knew the resident. Possibly to drop the rifles and tannarite off.</p>\n<p>Neighbors think it's a prowler and call cops.</p>\n<p>He was found a short time later. They discovered tannarite, a can of gasoline, three rifles (An AR, a .22, and a 30.06). He says he was going to attend the pride festival. Chief of Police makes statements about a man with an NRA sticker had makings for an IED and multiple assault rifles. Was going to pride and wanted to harm as many as he could.</p>\n<p>The CoP retracted later, saying all he stated was he was attending the pride festival.</p>\n<p>The guy had a restraining order saying he could not have firearms. He was also charged with transporting rifles (not sure on specifics in Cali, but maybe it is one of those 'within reach'?)</p>\n<p>Basically, he had the bad timing of it all happening hours after Orlando while the media was desperately looking for a white face to blame.</p>\n<p>What the fuck is wrong with people?</p>\n<p>EDIT TO ADD: Tannarite, in case unfamiliar is used in target shooting-it explodes on a sharp impact. the AR or 06 would cause it to explode, dropping would not, punching would not, a .22 calibre would not. Mixing gasoline to it would do nothing, though would probably denature and turn to sludge. The article was hand waving alluding to it being the same type of bomb used at OKC by McVeigh. It is nothing like that at all, by any stretch.</p>\n<p>So, this guys life is probably ruined, all because he was dumb, and people knee jerked to hell.</p>"],[2,5520164,5519756,1,0,1,"2016-06-15T19:35:09","Womb_Raider","",[],"<p>Yeah.... he does sound kinda stupid. Why not call the man on a phone?</p>"],[1,5520567,0,3,1,2,"2016-06-15T20:09:11","AlphaWookie","",[],"<p>Where is the uncensored version?</p>"],[1,5520807,0,4,0,4,"2016-06-15T20:27:11","CervicalStrike","",[],"<p>Someone needs to silence this &quot;Zyklon&quot; Ben Garrison! Oy gevalt, he's like a walking Treblinka!</p>"]]
